@startuml

participant "Root caller" as Caller
participant "Root IRS" as Root
participant "Root Digital Twin Registry" as RootDtr
participant "Root EDC" as RootEdc
participant "Root Submodel Provider" as RootSubmodel
participant "Child EDC" as ChildEdc
participant "Child IRS" as Child
participant "Child Digital Twin Registry" as ChildDtr
participant "Child Submodel Provider" as ChildSubmodel

== Root job submission ==

Caller -> Root: POST /irs/recursive/jobs
activate Root
Root -> Root: validate request and chain opening grant
Root --> Caller: 201 Created (jobId)
deactivate Root

Root -> Root: start asynchronous job processing
activate Root
note right of Root
  Processing continues asynchronously.
  See processing phases 3-6 below.
end note

== Root traversal ==

Root -> RootDtr: lookup shell by globalAssetId
RootDtr --> Root: shell descriptor
Root -> RootEdc: request SingleLevelBomAsPlanned submodel
RootEdc -> RootSubmodel: EDC data transfer
RootSubmodel --> RootEdc: BOM payload
RootEdc --> Root: BOM payload
Root -> Root: extract direct BOM children
Root -> Root: filter direct children by grant
Root -> Root: persist child branches and AWAITING_CHILDREN

== Child request dispatch (allowed children exist) ==

loop for each allowed direct child
    Root -> RootEdc: send recursive REQUEST notification
    RootEdc -> ChildEdc: EDC transfer
    ChildEdc -> Child: POST /irs/recursive/notifications
    activate Child
    Child -> Child: validate routing, payload and chain opening grant
    Child --> ChildEdc: 200 OK (accepted)
    deactivate Child
end
deactivate Root

== Child processing (one direct child) ==

Child -> Child: start asynchronous child job processing
activate Child
Child -> ChildDtr: lookup shell by globalAssetId
ChildDtr --> Child: shell descriptor
Child -> ChildEdc: request SingleLevelBomAsPlanned submodel
ChildEdc -> ChildSubmodel: EDC data transfer
ChildSubmodel --> ChildEdc: BOM payload
ChildEdc --> Child: BOM payload
Child -> Child: extract direct BOM children
Child -> ChildEdc: request PartTypeInformation and anonymized PURIS submodels
ChildEdc -> ChildSubmodel: EDC data transfers
ChildSubmodel --> ChildEdc: material metadata and anonymized payloads
ChildEdc --> Child: material metadata and local items
Child -> Child: filter direct BOM children by grant

alt allowed direct children exist
    Child -> Child: persist child branches and AWAITING_CHILDREN
    loop for each allowed direct child
        Child -> ChildEdc: send recursive REQUEST notification through EDC
    end
    deactivate Child
    note over Child
        Processing returns after the child requests are sent.
        A later child response or the timeout sweeper resumes the job.
    end note
    Child -> Child: resume after final child response or timeout
    activate Child
    Child -> Child: apply final child response or mark open branches TIMED_OUT
    Child -> Child: aggregate childItems, items and tombstones
else leaf or no allowed direct children
    Child -> Child: persist COMPLETED state
    Child -> Child: aggregate childItems, items and tombstones
end

== Upstream response ==

Child -> ChildEdc: send recursive RESPONSE notification
deactivate Child
ChildEdc -> RootEdc: EDC transfer
RootEdc -> Root: POST /irs/recursive/notifications
activate Root
Root -> Root: validate and correlate child response
Root -> Root: update child branch and aggregate terminal result when complete
Root --> RootEdc: 200 OK (accepted)
deactivate Root

== Result polling ==

Caller -> Root: GET /irs/recursive/jobs/{jobId}
activate Root
Root --> Caller: job envelope and recursive result
deactivate Root

@enduml
